grade-fail={"id":"poland_events_2026.p0_breakthrough_watch_2026","source":"source/scenes/poland_events_2026.scene.dry:935","proseGrade":"","proseAudit":"","historicalDate":"Dated by source availability: continuous_campaign = 1 and year >= 2026 and p0_formed = 1 and p0_poll >= 2.5 and p0_alert_event_done = 0","factualBaseline":"The project built around Krzysztof Stanowski has crossed from personality to organisation. In the current model it is strongest among anti-establishment younger voters, but its losses are spread across PiS , Konfederacja and parts of KO . No bloc can treat it as someone else's problem. The danger for Lewica is twofold: the radical right's language gets a new, media-native vehicle, and every democratic rival may chase it with harder security and market rhetoric.","peopleIntroduced":[],"organisationsIntroduced":["Lewica","PiS","KO","Konfederacja"],"requiredRole":"Lewica national leadership under the live constitutional role shown by the event","legalAuthority":"Authority is limited to the named office, chamber, party body or cabinet actor; party leadership cannot exercise another institution’s power.","availabilityConditions":"continuous_campaign = 1 and year >= 2026 and p0_formed = 1 and p0_poll >= 2.5 and p0_alert_event_done = 0","choices":[{"id":"poland_events_2026.p0_response_isolate_2026","title":"Isolate the party as a media vehicle, not a programme","subtitle":"Deny it anti-system glamour and force specific policy comparisons.","subtitleSource":"source","availabilityConditions":"Available whenever the parent event is active.","authorityStage":"proposal","immediateConsequence":"media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 1; p0_poll_momentum -= 0.12; p0_ai_actions -= 1 if p0_ai_actions > 0; news_headline = \"Lewica treats Partia Zero as a media vehicle rather than a governing offer\"","delayedCallbacks":["media_capacity","news_headline","p0_ai_actions","p0_poll_momentum","public_trust"],"mediaPublicReception":["Lewica treats Partia Zero as a media